*HEADING
A5b: 3x3x1 C4 lattice, 3 mm elements (444 B31, edges 2.6-3.2 mm so the contact radius need not be reduced), r 0.8, linear elastic E = 40 MPa (stroke ~8.8 mm, contact active, no bottoming out), 0.75 J at 6 m/s, impactor bonded to the rigid top plate; beam-beam contact with the full section radius, Coulomb friction mu = 0.5; no plate contact
** Generated by abaqus/cases.py from latticeSetup.drop_rig(start='merged', lattice_contact=self, mu=0.5).
** Units: mm, N, s, tonne, MPa. Ref node 337 = impactor + plate (mass M + plate = 4.107856e-05 t); the lattice's own
** lumped mass of the top nodes adds through the rigid body (as in ours). Rotations of the plate fixed.
